@startuml
title SD04 - Handle failed delivery (UC12 / AD27)
autonumber
actor "Courier" as Courier
participant "route:Route" as Route
actor "Customer contact" as Contact
participant "first:DeliveryAttempt" as First
participant "second:DeliveryAttempt" as Second
participant "order:Order" as Order
actor "Sales employee" as Sales
Courier -> Route: showSchedule(date)
Route --> Courier: assigned stops, address and delivery time
Courier -> Courier: lookUpCustomerPhoneNumber(customer)
Courier -> Contact: Call after first unanswered visit
Contact --> Courier: availability
alt Customer can receive during first visit
  Courier -> First: recordReceiptSignature()
  First --> Courier: signature saved
  Courier -> First: markDelivered(timestamp)
  First --> Courier: delivery registered
  Courier -> Order: changeOrderStatus(delivered)
  Order --> Courier: status updated
else Customer cannot receive during first visit
  Courier -> First: markRecipientAbsent()
  First --> Courier: first attempt recorded
  Courier -> Route: adjustSchedule()
  Route --> Courier: second visit scheduled today
  alt Customer receives delivery during second visit
    Courier -> Second: recordReceiptSignature()
    Second --> Courier: signature saved
    Courier -> Second: markDelivered(timestamp)
    Second --> Courier: delivery registered
    Courier -> Order: changeOrderStatus(delivered)
    Order --> Courier: status updated
  else Customer absent during second visit
    Courier -> Second: markRecipientAbsent()
    Second --> Courier: second attempt recorded
    Courier -> Order: changeOrderStatus(notDelivered)
    Order --> Courier: status updated
    note right of Courier: Return goods to the distribution area.
    Courier -> Sales: Report failed delivery
    Sales -> Contact: Agree new delivery date and time slot
    Contact --> Sales: new date and time slot
    Sales -> Order: setDeliveryTime(date, timeSlot)
    Order --> Sales: appointment updated
    Sales -> Order: recordAdditionalDeliveryCosts(amount, explanation)
    Order --> Sales: additional costs recorded
  end
end
@enduml
